v 3
d xtutest: Test for an inverse U (or U) and estimate the turning point in heterogeneous panels
d
d CCE mean-group (Pesaran 2006) intersection-union test of Lind and Mehlum (2010) for an
d inverse U- or U-shaped relationship in panels with heterogeneous slopes and common
d factors; turning point of the mean curve with Fieller and delta intervals; median of the
d unit turning points with an order-statistic interval; Pesaran CD test; pooled
d fixed-effects comparison; graphs. Unbalanced panels allowed. Version 1.2.0 adds CCE pooled, fixed-effects, random-effects,
d fixed-effects IV and system GMM variants, and residual diagnostics (serial
d correlation, heteroskedasticity, normality, stability) for every estimator.
d
d Author: Yusuf Toyin Yusuf, Kwara State University
d Support: yusuf.yusuf@kwasu.edu.ng
d
d Distribution-Date: 20261020
d Stata version 14
